// Lara approaches the first party member she sees and initiates her warning once.
// This deliberately mirrors the proven Kira/Delcia pattern used in earlier
// Better Immersion components: See([PC]) + LastSeenBy(Myself).
IF
    See([PC])
    Global("QCFLaraState","LOCALS",0)
    !StateCheck(Myself,CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
THEN
    RESPONSE #100
        SetGlobal("QCFLaraState","LOCALS",1)
        MoveToObject(LastSeenBy(Myself))
        StartDialogueNoSet(LastSeenBy(Myself))
END
